        "destination": "fixture:owner",
        "body": "Monthly deployment and production-error digest \u2014 fixture day 240, 2027-09-01.\n\nThe source audit identifies a new provider quota reduction. Verified revision 3 had quota 100 requests/minute against demand 300/minute, HTTP 429 rate 18%, and HTTP 401 rate zero (measurement-10). This is a new configuration change, not a retraction of the earlier revision-2 recovery or evidence against the still-unexposed retry-jitter PR 208. No sustained-health claim is made for the unobserved intervening period.\n\nRestored quota 500/minute with retry_jitter=false at revision 4 (deployment effect-12) after checking related work and reserving the fifth evaluation slot (effect-11). Independent status confirms the experiment began on day 240. Measurement-13 verifies new production exposure and immediate 429 reduction to 0.3% under reported demand 300/minute, with 401 zero. The new observation is immature, sustained_window_days=0; the experiment remains open pending at least 14 days of current exposure. The old recovery window is not credited toward this evaluation.\n\nReused the prior passing functional validation of this identical configuration at the same demand. Current project-credit-ledger is 9/10 validation credits consumed, no reset; this session spent zero. Four other evaluations plus ours fill the five-slot capacity. Footer work is compatible; the audit was reconciled without pooling across revisions.\n\nFollow-up is confirmed for fixture day 254, 2027-09-15 (schedule effect-14 and independent status). Check effective quota/demand, revision and actual exposure, mature recovery, separate 401s and any new corrections before settlement. Raw denominators, burst/account distribution, backlog/sync health, exact time of the provider reduction and recurrence prevention remain uncertain. Continue monitoring for further quota changes. Responsibility remains active; no owner decision or pause is needed. Evidence and the next-session handoff are retained in memory/."
      },
      "result": {
        "receipt": "effect-15",
        "delivered_to": "fixture:owner",
        "message_number": 1
      },
